why A robe or a tunic for Horde mages in their late 20s.

# The Horde mage robe at 26: Speak with Deino (1943), Waters of Xavian (1944),
# Laughing Sisters (1945) and Nether-lace Garment (1946).
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json for the chain,
# the Xavian Waterfall and the Laughing Sisters; Forever's Mage class
# quest list (data/local/quest-audit/, all four unchanged)
# and quest data (quests 1943, 1944, 1945 and
# 1946, checked 2026-10-14) for the reward choice; the races: Forever's
# server (EG Link raceMask, builds 70205-70450) sets no race limit on
# 1943-1946, so Orc mages take the chain too (forever-db corrections; the
# quest page's Undead and Troll is Classic's list, from before Orc mages);
# the quest texts for the
# waterfall and Raynewood Retreat; the KB drops table (Laughing Sister's Hair
# 100%) and npcs.json (24 Laughing Sisters, level 24); data/local/mechanics
# (quest-steps and quest-notes, checked 2026-10-20) for the flask's spot under
# the northern falls against the rock, the western-fork falls that do not
# work, the sisters' resistances and the Raynewood guards.
# Waters of Xavian needs Speak with Deino first (quests.json), and only
# Anastasia Hartwell in the Undercity gives it. Laughing Sisters opens only
# after Waters of Xavian, so Ashenvale is visited twice.

step Anastasia Hartwell
  zone Undercity
  tip Anastasia Hartwell stands in the Undercity's Magic Quarter. Orcs and Trolls use Teleport: Undercity or take the zeppelin from Orgrimmar to Tirisfal Glades for her.
  level 26
  accept 1943                                 -- Anastasia Hartwell

step Deino
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Take the zeppelin to Orgrimmar (or use Teleport: Orgrimmar, which lands you on the upper floor of Darkbriar Lodge). Deino stands with the mage trainers on the lower floor of Darkbriar Lodge in the Valley of Spirits. She hands you Deino's Flask.
  turnin 1943                                 -- Deino
  accept 1944

step The Xavian Waterfall
  zone Ashenvale
  tip Fly to Splintertree Post and swim north up the river past the big lake to its far northern end, where the zone text reads Xavian; satyrs hold the ruins around it and a few river beasts are in the way. Swim right in under the highest waterfall until you touch the rock wall, then use the flask (you can stay in the water). The waterfalls on the western Falfarren fork do not work.
  use 7269 quest 1944.1 @76.29,41.49          -- Deino's Flask, under the falls
  collect 7268 quest 1944.1                   -- Xavian Water Sample

step Back to Deino
  zone Orgrimmar
  turnin 1944                                 -- Deino
  accept 1945

step The Laughing Sisters
  zone Ashenvale
  tip The Laughing Sisters, dryads of level 24-25, roam around the Raynewood Retreat in central Ashenvale; every one drops a hair and they come back after 5 minutes. They often resist fire (and some frost and shadow): arcane spells land best. Each runs for help at low health. Keep clear of the guards by the white tower of the retreat, who hit hard.
  collect 7270 x12 quest 1945.1               -- Laughing Sister's Hair

step Kil'hala
  zone The Barrens
  tip Kil'hala, a troll tailor, works at the Crossroads. The robe gives intellect, stamina and spirit; the tunic more intellect and stamina but no spirit.
  turnin 1945                                 -- Kil'hala
  accept 1946
  turnin 1946 choose 7512 9515                -- Nether-lace Garment
